<title>USA: Sobik's Subs Inc changes company name.</title>
<headline>Sobik's Subs Inc changes company name.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sobik's Subs Inc said on Friday the company had changed its name to Interfoods of America Inc.</p>
<p>Interfoods of America Inc is the franchisor of Sobik's Subs, a 54-unit sub sandwich chain.</p>
<p>The parent company will now be traded under the new symbol &quot;IFDA&quot; on the OTC.</p>
